m square flange, 0.25 m round collar with a bore of 0.112 m) and the elevation: a hollow collar tube with a rolled bead, a 12 mm flange plate, three stacked square sheet cones (lofts with squareness 12) and four domed screw heads. The bore stays closed in the body because the drawing paints the opening as a filled disc.","de":"Eigenes Modell für 1:50 nach Grundriss (quadratischer Flansch 0,595 m, runder Kragen 0,25 m mit 0,112 m Bohrung) und Ansicht: ein hohler Kragen mit Wulst, eine 12 mm Flanschplatte, drei gestapelte quadratische Blechkegel (Lofts mit Eckigkeit 12) und vier gewölbte Schraubenköpfe. Die Bohrung bleibt im Körper geschlossen, weil die Zeichnung die Öffnung als gefüllte Scheibe malt."},{"en":"Thermal: the plate region is the exposed surface of the flange, the three cones and the screw heads (references to the body solids, buried faces do not count), the collar region the outer face of the collar as an open tube skin; the two supply jets are 0.04 m nozzles at the outlet slots. Single-layer sheets of 0.8 mm and 0.7 mm are surfaces, so no nested shells are needed.","de":"Thermik: die Region Platte ist die freie Fläche von Flansch, den drei Kegeln und den Schraubenköpfen (Verweise auf die Körper, verdeckte Flächen zählen nicht), die Region Kragen die Aussenfläche des Kragens als offene Rohrhaut; die zwei Zuluftstrahlen sind Düsen von 0,04 m an den Auslassschlitzen. Einlagige Bleche von 0,8 mm und 0,7 mm sind Flächen, verschachtelte Schalen entfallen."},{"en":"Structure: the flange plate carries the 3.2 kg through the two hangers (pin left as a vertical stud through the plate, roller right as a transverse roller at the plate top); a compact mass ellipsoid sits at the centre of mass. One member solid is right here: the diffuser is a single rigid part (one rig bone) that hangs from its two ceiling hangers, so the flange plate is the whole load path and the cones and collar are cladding.","de":"Tragwerk: die Flanschplatte trägt die 3,2 kg über die zwei Halter (links ein Festlager als senkrechter Bolzen durch die Platte, rechts ein Rollenlager als Querrolle auf der Plattenoberseite); ein kompakter Massenellipsoid liegt im Schwerpunkt. Ein Stabkörper ist hier richtig: der Auslass ist ein einziges starres Teil (eine Rig-Bone), das an seinen zwei Deckenhaltern hängt; die Flanschplatte ist der ganze Lastpfad, Kegel und Stutzen sind Verkleidung."}]},"100":{"status":"authored","denominator":100,"body":[{"id":"collar","kind":"extrude","bone":"body","material":"galvanised-steel","role":"body","tone":0.5,"profile":[[0.125,0.0],[0.12393,0.01632],[0.12074,0.03235],[0.11548,0.04784],[0.10825,0.0625],[0.09917,0.0761],[0.08839,0.08839],[0.0761,0.09917],[0.0625,0.10825],[0.04784,0.11548],[0.03235,0.12074],[0.01632,0.12393],[0.0,0.125],[-0.01632,0.12393],[-0.03235,0.12074],[-0.04784,0.11548],[-0.0625,0.10825],[-0.0761,0.09917],[-0.08839,0.08839],[-0.09917,0.0761],[-0.10825,0.0625],[-0.11548,0.04784],[-0.12074,0.03235],[-0.12393,0.01632],[-0.125,0.0],[-0.12393,-0.01632],[-0.12074,-0.03235],[-0.11548,-0.04784],[-0.10825,-0.0625],[-0.09917,-0.0761],[-0.08839,-0.08839],[-0.0761,-0.09917],[-0.0625,-0.10825],[-0.04784,-0.11548],[-0.03235,-0.12074],[-0.01632,-0.12393],[0.0,-0.125],[0.01632,-0.12393],[0.03235,-0.12074],[0.04784,-0.11548],[0.0625,-0.10825],[0.0761,-0.09917],[0.08839,-0.08839],[0.09917,-0.0761],[0.10825,-0.0625],[0.11548,-0.04784],[0.12074,-0.03235],[0.12393,-0.01632]],"plane":"zx","from":0.0,"to":0.05,"holes":[[[0.1,0.0],[0.09914,0.01305],[0.09659,0.02588],[0.09239,0.03827],[0.0866,0.05],[0.07934,0.06088],[0.07071,0.07071],[0.06088,0.07934],[0.05,0.0866],[0.03827,0.09239],[0.02588,0.09659],[0.01305,0.09914],[0.0,0.1],[-0.01305,0.09914],[-0.02588,0.09659],[-0.03827,0.09239],[-0.05,0.0866],[-0.06088,0.07934],[-0.07071,0.07071],[-0.07934,0.06088],[-0.0866,0.05],[-0.09239,0.03827],[-0.09659,0.02588],[-0.09914,0.01305],[-0.1,0.0],[-0.09914,-0.01305],[-0.09659,-0.02588],[-0.09239,-0.03827],[-0.0866,-0.05],[-0.07934,-0.06088],[-0.0707